OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's emergency stroke unit
OL,4,Acloses
OL,5,
OL,6,FStroke patients requiring urgent care
OL,7,Fin part of the West Country will be
OL,8,Ftaken to hospitals 20 to 30 miles away
OL,9,Ffrom Wednesday, an NHS care board has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FYeovil Hospital's emergency hyper-acute
OL,13,Fstroke unit is closing despite a
OL,14,Fcampaign to keep it open - and patients
OL,15,Fwill be taken to Taunton or Dorchester
OL,16,Finstead.
OL,18,FCampaigners had argued there was "no
OL,19,Flogic" in the closure, which they said
OL,20,Fleft patients at risk. Yeovil Hospital
OL,21,Fwill retain its acute stroke provision
OL,22,Fon site.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
