OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's emergency stroke unit
OL,4,Acloses
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Bernie Marden, chief medical officer
OL,7,Frepresenting NHS Somerset and NHS
OL,8,FDorset integrated care boards, said
OL,9,Fthey were "committed" to finding the
OL,10,Fbest solution for all stroke patients
OL,11,Fin Somerset and Dorset.
